      "value": "Using a different controller than OP, but it uses Force loco anims off and can turn on/off animations ingame via toggle.\nThe behaviour seems, that as soon as hip getting set to animate, that the head gets set to animate as well, since it follows whatever the animation dictates and rotates the whole avatar when you look around.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
